gue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.83,Title,,0,0,240,,The Curse of HeartDialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Has your sword ever broken?Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's happened a few times, I guess.Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Including by you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:06.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Were it clad in Haki,Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,that same sword would not have shattered.Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The slightest nick to your blades is a shame to you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Every sword can become a Black Blade.Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Until you master it, drinking is forbidden.Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.49,0:02:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,No nicks.Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:43.36,Captions,,880,0,280,,Behind the Former Royal PlateasuDialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Was anyone harmed?Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:46.02,Main,,0,0,0,,No, sir. It's all thanks to you, Isshou-san.Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you temporarily levitated those stones, there are no casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we already set up downtown as an evacuation zone.Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Well done.Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.90,Captions,,992,0,295,,Port town AcaciaDialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That giant statue was sliced completely in half!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the top commander was done in?Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:08.12,Captions,,940,0,305,,Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Pica-sama's down!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,He's that strong, and yet he didn't enter the competition?Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What a humble guy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That power, yet he's merely Garp's grandson's subordinate?Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He's good!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We managed to protect King Riku in the end, so I'll let it go. But still...Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The factory...!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The factory that rose from the ground exploded!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:42.12,Captions,,0,900,245,,Inside the SMILE factoryDialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.86,Main,,0,0,0,,One more time!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Blow the factory to bits for making us suffer!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:04:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll never be fooled or forced to work again!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Pica has been defeated and the factory just exploded, Doffy.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But the defeated will be brought back. The factory will be restored.Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Celebrate while you can!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We still have the Healing Fruit power user, Mansherry, on our side!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Robiland!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:42.11,Captions,,880,0,230,,The Fourth Level Outside the Palace The Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander! You're Commander Kyros, right?Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup! I see you rescued the princess, Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You look so gallant! A spitting image of the statue!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the other way around.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're badly injured. I'll heal you right away.Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, hold on.Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be Princess Mansherry.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot about your power, but there must be some limit to it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't use it on me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But you're bleeding everywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:23.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm still conscious.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,More importantly, I'm glad that you're okay. It must have been tough.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:32.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're willing to use your power, there are people all over the country in need of it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What? This is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.90,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Dressrosa?Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo and the others explained the situation to me,Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect it to be this bad...Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, it looks like they succeeded in destroying the factory.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle has come to a crucial point!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,This country was entrapped by Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:15.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether we can return it to the hands of King Riku...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,or fall once again and become a land of despair...Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Our hope now rests with a certain band of pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.16,Main,,0,0,0,,In the royal palace...Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,On the top floor...Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffyland... Lawland...Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two are our last resort.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Traf-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy...Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:17.83,Captions,,840,0,280,,Beneath the Palace Inside the Outer Wall TowerDialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:25.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I've just entered the rampart tower.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like something bad's about to go down.Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun, can't you get here? Where are you?Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm helping trapped prisoners escape from the Colosseum.Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too far away.Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You can handle pretty much anything on your own, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If I thought I could handle this, I wouldn't be calling you! This might affect Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:53.23,Captions,,880,0,280,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Do you need a hand?Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm okay! Ain't a scratch on me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro, thank you! I thought I was done for!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro-dono, very well done!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate, thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:27.44,Main,,0,0,0,,When I saw you cut that giant statue with your swords, I could hardly believe my eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold off on the excitement until that suffocating cage disappears!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:42.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's still there, which means the key man hasn't been defeated yet.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:53.76,Captions,,0,0,175,,Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:09:00.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,First FloorDialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:25.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard isn't worth risking your life for!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That's for me to decide!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Your body's in tatters already...Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If you keep fighting, you really will die!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:26.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I die, if I can take you down...Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:32.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo might at least remember me a little!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He said he set you free, but...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:07.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Bellamy. I set you free.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:10.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Like you have always been.Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,...you didn't run, and now you're fighting me to the death...Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He must have known you'd do this.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he did! But so what?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I respect him!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can at least die in a way that would impress him...Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be content!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lie! This is the only option you have left, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:42.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you're a man!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,If you understand that much, shut up and fight!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But you'll die for nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, this is what I want.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:03.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If I'm to meet my end, it should be...Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:07.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,by another man that I admire!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The sky!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:26.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! Bellamy has changed!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You've changed, Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:35.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:40.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to fight me...Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just...Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.91,Main,,0,0,0,,kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Why're you just standing there?! Put 'em up, coward!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:13:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If you know how to throw a punch, that is!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Die!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:11.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So long, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:16.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling me your friend!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:53.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I get it now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:59.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That I admired the wrong man! And how pathetic I am!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I know I'm an idiot...Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:09.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,but even an idiot has principles he must stick to!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:39.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The beast is roaring.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.26,Main,,0,0,0,,He should hurry on up here.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be surprised, Law...Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:54.97,Main,,0,0,0,,When he sees your dead body.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:04.36,Captions,,0,245,360,,A few minutes agoDialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:04.36,Captions,,310,0,40,,The Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Sticky Launcher!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, Law. Why don't you just accept defeat already?Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:28.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You really should rest, Law.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:37.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not even a match for me on my own.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to challenge both of us at the same time?Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat won't make it up here that easily.Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,If he had the guts to kill his "friend" right off the bat,Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:56.78,Main,,0,0,0,,he might have been able to save you, but...Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He's such a naive idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Born in the hell that was White Town...Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Spending your entire childhood with no hope whatsoever for your future...Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:14.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But then you met my younger brother, Corazón.Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He extended your life expectancy,Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and you carried on resenting me, as if you were a ghost of him...Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Living only for revenge, what an astounding obsession!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.68,Main,,0,0,0,,it ends now.Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste of thirteen years.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Your death is inevitable.Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:51.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You will die a completely meaningless death!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,But, if you're going to die anyway...Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:02.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you rather make something of it?Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I have an idea we'd both benefit from.Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say this once, so listen carefully, Trafalgar D. Water Law.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Perform the ultimate Operation Fruit technique on me... the Eternal Youth Operation... and die.Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:32.01,Main,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I'll grant your wish, whatever it is.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is?Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If you really mean it...Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:42.37,Main,,0,0,0,,it's a brilliant idea. We'd both benefit from it.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:44.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm in!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a very understanding man! Doffy will finally have eternal life!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring Cora-san back to life, right now!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,When you're finished doing that, go lick the asses of everyone in the country!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,"No match for" you? "No use pinning my hopes"?Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:16.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one not seeing the whole picture, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:23.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have caused all sorts of miracles in the past.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't beat Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to reclaim Caesar from him, either!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, how dare you say that to Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's your future that's hanging by a thread-Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,The letters on your back, "Corazón"?Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to mock me?Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And then there's the name of your crew, the "Heart Pirates"!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to mock me?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't even sit on the Seat of Hearts!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.64,Main,,0,0,0,,So why do you bear the Heart crest?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,So irritating!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:42.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, Corazón... This is it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to carry on your ridiculous tenacity!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The curse you've cast on me is broken!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.57,Captions,,0,235,360,,Present timeDialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.57,Captions,,0,0,40,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:15.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat just took down Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That leaves two major enemies in the Donquixote Family.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:26.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The only ones left are the top commander and chief of staff, Trebol,Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and the Family boss, Donquixote Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.07,0:20:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Viola-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:44.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola?Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Our ranks have shrunk as well!Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,"Our ranks"? You mean out of us was taken out?Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Your majesty?Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:26.51,Main,,0,0,0,,In a situation where we can't let our guard down at any time,Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,it's all the more important to keep our people out of harm's way.Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:37.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go down to the city right now!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to minimize casualties!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Even though we can't fight, there are still things we can do!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, all that's left is...Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,To put an end...Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,to everything.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:14.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:25.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You're late, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that I've emancipated him,Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy has become "free", right?Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb! You knew full well...Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:45.32,Main,,0,0,0,,that he wasn't gonna run away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Elephant Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Spiderweb!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:23:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. So Bellamy didn't run away.Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:05.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.62,0:23:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Break White!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.15,0:23:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traf! Why're you bleeding so much?Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.56,0:23:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to your arm?Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.06,0:23:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.80,0:24:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Traf! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Traf!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He's dead. Obviously.Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It is.Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,He seemed to have a great deal of faith in you, too.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He said you can work miracles. Can you, Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were that strong when I fought you, though...Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:34.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it on! There's only two of us left.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.99,0:24:37.99,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.40,0:24:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stay where you are!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The wall of strings...Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.14,0:25:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,is shrinking!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have you follow Law in death shortly.Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's end this game, shall we?Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:33.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.10,0:25:34.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wait.Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:38.48,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Straw Hatter.Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.06,0:26:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It really is moving.Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The string wall's moving!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.71,0:26:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Run for it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.56,0:26:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even the outskirts of town are safe!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make a break for it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.11,0:26:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Get to downtown!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:40.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the same in the west!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:44.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Reporting in! Eastern district, Carta!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Per other reports, the bird cage appears to be shrinking!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:26:57.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The islanders are all headed toward downtown!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:27:01.24,Captions,,0,0,175,,The Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:26:59.16,0:27:01.22,Main,,0,0,3,,Sooner or later...Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:05.18,Main,,0,0,0,,everyone dies, correct?Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.52,0:27:11.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, haven't you noticed?Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.82,0:27:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The rules of the game have changed.Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.19,0:27:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Game? What are you on about now?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Just listen.Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.69,0:27:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage that surrounds this town is shrinking, bit by bit.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.34,0:27:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like an umbrella, slowly closing.Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.63,0:27:42.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll shred apart everything in this country.Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.38,0:27:44.97,Main,,0,0,0,,In about...Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,an hour, give or take.Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.56,0:27:57.69,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.36,0:28:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Save the people on the outskirts of the country, on the double!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:03.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.69,0:28:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The weaker citizens have been evacuated to the edges of the city, so hurry and get them!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.57,0:28:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Run to the center part of town!Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Here come the strings!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.74,0:28:23.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Somebody, help me!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.24,0:28:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Just freeing my legs would work!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.30,0:28:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Untie me! I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,T-T-The bird cage is shrinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:37.79,Captions,,0,0,175,,Former Royal GroundsDialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:38.02,Secondary,,0,0,3,,What's going on?! The bird cage... The bird cage...Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:37.27,Main,,0,0,3,,Is this truly happening?Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:38.14,Main,,0,0,3,,My word...Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What do we do?! What can we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.85,0:28:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The cage is heading toward us!  What's gonna happen to us?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We finally busted out from behind bars, only to be put behind them again?Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.54,0:28:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are we supposed to run?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:29:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,How can he stoop so low?Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you not yet satisfied, Doflamingo?Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If the cage keeps shrinking like this...Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.02,0:29:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it for Dressrosa!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.49,0:29:14.29,Captions,,0,0,180,,The Royal Palace Grounds - Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:18.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What's all that smoke and rumbling?Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.35,0:29:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What in the world's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.32,0:29:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry up! Kick Doflamingo's ass already!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You're our last hope!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That is right! Indeed! Certainly!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.63,0:29:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But that is too much to ask. The lives of everyone are in Luffy-dono's hands.Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We are counting on you, Luffy-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I am counting on you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.62,0:29:50.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not planning on sparing anyone.Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.56,0:30:02.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What advantage would I gain in allowing people that have learned this country's secrets survive?Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.54,0:30:13.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Towns, people, animals...Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Even your allies...Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.67,0:30:22.09,Main,,0,0,0,,And you! Everyone dies!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.51,0:30:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, your friends just died a little earlier than they otherwise would have.Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.98,0:30:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Straw Hatter?Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what he used to call you?Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.08,0:30:55.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you needn't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll build another country.Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.82,0:31:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo, all I have to do to fix this is kick your ass!Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.45,0:31:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to tell you, you can't do that.Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.46,0:31:08.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You never learn!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.27,0:31:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Bullet String!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.72,0:31:14.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.10,0:31:16.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Join Law in death!Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:18.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.40,0:31:24.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one that's going to perish, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:31.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.08,0:31:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,This operation will destroy you from the inside out!Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.28,0:31:50.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Gamma Knife!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.94,0:32:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.98,0:32:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Law! How are you still alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.66,0:32:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,How are you using your Operation abilities without creating a Room?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No, this is a Room!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.28,0:32:26.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's at the cost of some of my lifespan, but I created a Room so big you can't even see it!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I did it all for this moment... to set up this attack!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.65,0:32:57.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He missed my vital organs!Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.12,0:32:59.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:11.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.08,0:33:12.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wait.Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.64,0:33:17.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.48,0:33:20.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Straw Hatter.Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.94,0:33:24.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't turn around. I have a plan.Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.58,0:33:31.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Nobody can defend against an attack from inside their body!Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.20,0:33:38.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Even you can't counteract this technique!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:59.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy, you're a king! Don't prostrate yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Now you've really done it!Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.32,0:34:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use!Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.83,0:34:12.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me, it's too late for you!Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you live...Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.04,0:34:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.48,0:34:26.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.10,0:34:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet Stamp!Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.64,0:34:46.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy! Are you alright?Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.08,0:34:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.17,0:34:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.90,0:35:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Traf...Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:09.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard... is mine!Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.22,0:35:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Room!Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.62,0:35:46.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.30,0:35:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you! What have you done to Doffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.22,0:36:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in his way!Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.22,0:36:17.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You just...Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.32,0:36:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,gathered people that were convenient to you and called it a "family".Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.68,0:36:33.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And when your real brother, Cora-san, tried to end your rampage, you...Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.02,0:36:37.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's free!Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.60,0:36:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was a shame...Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.40,0:36:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He betrayed me... even pointed a gun at me...Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,But you knew!Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.04,0:37:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You knew Cora-san couldn't pull the trigger!Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.98,0:37:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I would have pulled it.Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.72,0:37:22.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet you would have.Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.22,0:37:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the same as me.Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.72,0:37:34.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I wanna destroy everything before my eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:39.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Towns, houses, people... I wanna destroy them all!Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.74,0:37:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... That's fine by me.Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.28,0:37:50.74,Main,,0,0,0,,But on that day...Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.44,0:37:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You should have died, not him!Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.14,0:38:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, I'm sure you'll love to hear this...Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.34,0:38:13.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón was a drag and an eyesore to me.Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.33,0:38:19.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He acquired this silly sense of justice and wore that worthless heart of his on his sleeve.Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,He was an incompetent man.Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.03,0:38:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When I killed him that day, it was a huge load off my-Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.96,0:38:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Counter Shock!Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.56,0:38:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to hell you demonic bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.50,0:39:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of our king!Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.56,0:39:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,H-How the hell...Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.61,0:39:50.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Given enough time, I can mend myself.Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.35,0:39:57.65,Main,,0,0,0,,As we speak, the strings within my body are repairing my internal organs.Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.65,0:39:58.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all about how you use your ability.Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.46,0:40:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a bit different from recovery, though.Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.90,0:40:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job on the suicide attack.Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sticky Chain!Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:20.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Sticky Stick!Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.12,0:40:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery. It's the least I can do.Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.12,0:40:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.40,0:40:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.92,0:41:05.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Galaxy 9000, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Mr. Luffy, Grug, Datenshi  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis